/21/2019 13 ORDER RESETTING as to Felipe Jesus Duron, ( Detention Hearing and Preliminary Hearing reset for 10/29/2019 10:00 AM before Judge\nRichard B. Farrer). Signed by Judge Richard B. Farrer. (mam) [5:19-mj-01188-HJB] (Entered: 10/24/2019)\n10/23/2019 14 Arrest Warrant Returned Executed on 10/15/19 as to Felipe Jesus Duron. (kh2) [5:19-mj-01188-HJB] (Entered: 10/29/2019)\n10/29/2019 15 Minute Entry for proceedings held before Judge Henry J. Bemporad:Preliminary Hearing as to Felipe Jesus Duron held on 10/29/2019\n(Minute entry documents are not available electronically.), Detention Hearing as to Felipe Jesus Duron held on 10/29/2019 (Minute entry\ndocuments are not available electronically.) (Court Reporter FTR GOLD.) (kh2) [5:19-mj-01188-HJB] (Entered: 10/30/2019)\n10/29/2019 16 ORDER GRANTING 4 Motion to Detain Defendant without Bond. as to Felipe Jesus Duron (1). Signed by Judge Richard B. Farrer. (kh2)\n[5:19-mj-01188-HJB] (Entered: 10/30/2019)\n11/06/2019 17 INDICTMENT (Redacted Version) with Notice of Forfeiture included as to FELIPE JESUS DURON. Unredacted document sealed\npursuant to E-Government Act of 2002 as to Felipe Jesus Duron (1) count(s) 1, 2, 3, 4. (rg) (Entered: 11/06/2019)\n11/06/2019 18 Personal Data Sheet (SEALED) as to Felipe Jesus Duron. (rg) (Entered: 11/06/2019)\n11/06/2019 20 ORDER Setting District Court Arraignment as to Felipe Jesus Duron. Arraignment set for 11/20/2019 2:00 PM before Judge Henry J.\nBemporad. Signed by Judge Elizabeth S. Chestney. (rg) (Entered: 11/06/2019)\n11/12/2019 21 NOTICE OF ATTORNEY APPEARANCE Fidel Esparza, III appearing for USA. Government's Notice of Appearance of Counsel (Esparza,\nFidel) (Entered: 11/12/2019)\n11/12/2019 Attorney Fidel Esparza, III for USA added. (rg) (Entered: 11/12/2019)\n11/12/2019 22 TRANSCRIPT filed of Proceedings as to Felipe Jesus Duron held on 10/29/2019 Proceedings Transcribed: Preliminary Hearing and\nDetention Hearing. Court Reporter/Transcriber Chris Poage, Telephone number 