sus Duron (1) Count 1,2,3,4. Referred to Probation for Presentence Report. (Minute entry documents are not\navailable electronically.) Guilty Plea Accepted by Court as to Felipe Jesus Duron (1) Count 1,2,3,4. (Court Reporter Chris Poage.) (rg)\n(Entered: 07/15/2020)\n07/15/2020 39 ORDER Setting Sentencing as to Felipe Jesus Duron. Sentencing set for 10/22/2020 9:30 AM before Judge Fred Biery. Signed by Judge\nFred Biery. (rg) (Entered: 07/15/2020)\n09/03/2020 40 ORDER Resetting Sentencing as to Felipe Jesus Duron; Sentencing RESET for 10/20/2020 09:00 AM before Judge Fred Biery. Signed by\nJudge Fred Biery. (bot1) (Entered: 09/03/2020)\n09/14/2020 41 ORDER as to Felipe Jesus Duron, (Resetting Sentencing for 1/12/2021 9:30 AM before Judge Fred Biery). Signed by Judge Fred Biery.\n(rg) (Entered: 09/14/2020)\n09/28/2020 42 NOTICE Advisory to the Court Regarding Forfeiture by USA as to Felipe Jesus Duron (Esparza, Fidel) (Entered: 09/28/2020)\n12/07/2020 43 INITIAL PRESENTENCE REPORT as to Felipe Jesus Duron by Officer Maria E. Holley. Objections to the PSR must be submitted\ndirectly to the Probation Department. Instructions for viewing the report are available here. (Document is available only to the attorney of\nrecord and AUSA for 14 days. PLEASE PRINT OR SAVE AS SOON AS DOCUMENT IS OPENED.) (Attachments: # 1 (Villarreal, Janet)\n(Entered: 12/07/2020)\n12/28/2020 44 MOTION to Continue Sentencing by Felipe Jesus Duron. (Douenat, Marina) (Entered: 12/28/2020)\n01/04/2021 45 ORDER GRANTING 44 Motion to Continue as to Felipe Jesus Duron (1). Sentencing reset for 3/16/2021 8:00 AM before Judge Fred\nBiery. Signed by Judge Fred Biery. (rg) (Entered: 01/04/2021)\n01/29/2021 47 Sealed Order. Signed by Judge Fred Biery. (cd) (Entered: 01/29/2021)\n01/29/2021 48 ORDER APPOINTING COUNSEL as to Felipe Jesus Duron Bernie Martinez for Felipe Jesus Duron appointed. Signed by Judge Richard\nB. Farrer. (rg) (Entered: 02/01/2021)\n03/08/2021 49 Unopposed MOTION to Continue Sentencing